WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.069 --> 00:00:13.276
Brad: I think they're catching up to us.

2
00:00:13.296 --> 00:00:16.659
Danny: We have to get to the bushes before they do.

3
00:00:16.679 --> 00:00:20.242
Brad: I hope the shrink-gun is still where we hid it.

4
00:00:22.143 --> 00:00:24.905
Chuck: Those two are faster than I thought.

5
00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:26.887
Dave: Look!

6
00:00:27.187 --> 00:00:28.588
They're running for the bushes.

7
00:00:31.351 --> 00:00:32.892
Chuck: I think they're trying to hide.

8
00:00:33.568 --> 00:00:36.390
Dave: They can run, but they can't hide from us!

9
00:00:39.191 --> 00:00:46.115
Chuck: Tell your friend that hiding won't help him.

10
00:00:46.135 --> 00:00:48.416
Brad: Oh, he's not scared of you.

11
00:00:48.436 --> 00:00:50.898
Dave: Oh, he will be.

12
00:00:51.358 --> 00:00:52.118
He will be!

13
00:00:52.198 --> 00:00:55.720
Danny: I don't think so!

14
00:00:56.881 --> 00:01:00.983
Danny: What's so funny?

15
00:01:03.044 --> 00:01:04.665
Chuck: Ha-ha!

16
00:01:05.285 --> 00:01:07.727
You think a toy gun can hurt us?

17
00:01:07.747 --> 00:01:11.129
Dave: Maybe the other one has a toy sword!

18
00:01:11.509 --> 00:01:15.431
Danny: Get up, you cowards!

19
00:01:17.532 --> 00:01:18.453
Chuck: Cowards?

20
00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:20.594
Don't call us cowards.

21
00:01:20.614 --> 00:01:23.596
Dave: You're going to wish you never said that!

22
00:01:23.976 --> 00:01:27.638
Danny: Brad, tell them what's going to happen to them!

23
00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:31.240
Brad: Look down at the ground.

24
00:01:32.356 --> 00:01:33.877
Do you see those tiny ants?

25
00:01:34.057 --> 00:01:40.421
Brad: Well, when Danny fires my shrink-gun─ Dave: Why is he talking to us about ants?

26
00:01:40.441 --> 00:01:44.104
Chuck: I think it's time to start beating them up.

27
00:01:44.124 --> 00:01:50.868
Chuck: It's going to be a long painful summer for you boys.

28
00:01:50.888 --> 00:01:54.030
Dave: There's no one to help you now.

29
00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.071
Danny: Bye-bye, Chuck!

30
00:01:56.331 --> 00:01:57.092
Bye-bye, Dave!

31
00:02:00.364 --> 00:02:02.325
Brad: That wasn't supposed to happen!

32
00:02:02.345 --> 00:02:05.947
Danny: Hey, you have to give that back!

33
00:02:07.088 --> 00:02:09.309
Chuck: What do you think this is supposed to do?

34
00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:10.910
Dave: I don't know.

35
00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.011
Maybe you should point it at them and find out!

36
00:02:15.432 --> 00:02:19.134
Brad: My dad's going to be so mad!

37
00:02:19.154 --> 00:02:23.597
Danny: We should have tested the shrink-gun more!

38
00:02:23.617 --> 00:02:25.838
Brad: I know, I know!

39
00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:30.781
Chuck: Bah, this is junk!

40
00:02:32.422 --> 00:02:33.403
Let's pound them.

41
00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:45.072
This gun works better if you have an imagination!

42
00:02:45.092 --> 00:02:47.995
Brad: Use it, Danny!

43
00:02:48.175 --> 00:02:48.455
Use it!

44
00:02:48.495 --> 00:02:50.957
Dave: How did he slip away?

45
00:02:50.977 --> 00:02:52.798
Chuck: I don't know.

46
00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:54.680
Let's get him first.

47
00:02:58.048 --> 00:02:59.690
Chuck: Bye-bye, Danny.

48
00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.092
Dave: Yeah.

49
00:03:01.232 --> 00:03:03.254
Bye-bye, little boy.
